        <section id="etf-landscape" class="scroll-mt-20">
            <div class="border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-4 mb-6">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-600">Section 01 • Vehicle Selection</span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-1">The Thematic ETF Spectrum: Concentration vs. Diversification</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-600 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-4xl mb-8">
                European UCITS ETFs targeting artificial intelligence and robotics fall into two distinct structural camps: mega-cap US technology funds concentrated in hyperscalers and chipmakers, and globally diversified industrial automation vehicles. Selecting an ETF requires trading off exposure to frontier compute power against single-country and single-sector concentration risk.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
                <div class="card-elevated p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
                    <div>
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">Top European UCITS AI & Robotics ETFs</h3>
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-100 text-blue-800">AUM & Fee Comparison</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
                            <strong>Xtrackers AI & Big Data (IE00BGV5VN51)</strong> dominates European assets (~€8.0B) with a low 0.35% TER, but allocates over 83% to the US. In contrast, <strong>L&G ROBO Global</strong> diversifies across Asia and Europe at a steeper 0.80% annual fee.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chart-container">
                        <canvas id="etfAumTerChart"></canvas>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="card-elevated p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
