                        </div>
                        <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mb-4">
                            Pure-play AI funds exhibit heavy top-10 concentration (nearly 45% in Xtrackers across Microsoft, Apple, Meta, Nvidia, and AMD), creating acute sensitivity to US hyperscaler capital expenditure cycles compared to robotics-blended funds.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="chart-container">
